# Local performance measurements
# Benchmarks: commit the scripts, fixtures, and the baselines and budgets CI reads. Run output
# and write-ups go in the PR or issue body, never in the tree (see AGENTS.md).
/bench/*
!/bench/*.exs
!/bench/latency_budgets.json
!/bench/fixtures/
!/bench/baselines/
/performance/results/
/performance/evidence/
/docs/performance/
/conformance-recovery-evidence/
/conformance-pixel-evidence/
